1
00:00:00,256 --> 00:00:04,651
Under Configure, open AHV Uplink Migration and choose PE

2
00:00:04,651 --> 00:00:08,013
direct. Prism Central is not required for this path.

3
00:00:08,149 --> 00:00:12,493
Enter the expected cluster UUID, PE endpoint and saved

4
00:00:12,501 --> 00:00:17,179
PE credential. Provide the CVM credential reference and independently verified

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,592
SSH host-key fingerprints for every CVM.

6
00:00:20,771 --> 00:00:23,465
Keep the required CVM-to-host trust intact.

7
00:00:23,715 --> 00:00:26,489
Certificate verification is enabled by default.

8
00:00:26,677 --> 00:00:30,679
If a permitted per-run exception is needed, enter its reason and review

9
00:00:30,773 --> 00:00:35,458
the risk: HTTPS remains encrypted, but the certificate no longer

10
00:00:35,466 --> 00:00:37,556
authenticates the PE endpoint.

11
00:00:37,742 --> 00:00:41,788
The exception is included in the plan, independent approval and audit.

12
00:00:41,881 --> 00:00:45,045
It never bypasses SSH host-key checks.

13
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:50,022
Run read-only discovery and verify identity, complete membership, health

14
00:00:50,116 --> 00:00:54,686
and inventory. Choose Create a new virtual switch, such as V S one,

15
00:00:54,694 --> 00:00:57,097
or a consistent existing destination.

16
00:00:57,297 --> 00:01:02,015
In PE-direct mode, V S one maps to local bridge B R one.

17
00:01:02,226 --> 00:01:06,570
For every host, retain at least two operational uplinks on B R zero

18
00:01:06,621 --> 00:01:08,035
and two at the destination.

19
00:01:08,285 --> 00:01:12,722
Review cabling, VLANs, MTU, capacity and console

20
00:01:12,722 --> 00:01:17,139
access. Run read-only preflight and have a different administrator approve

21
00:01:17,139 --> 00:01:18,667
the exact assignments.

22
00:01:18,845 --> 00:01:23,499
Live writes default to disabled pending representative hardware validation.

23
00:01:23,730 --> 00:01:28,074
A passed draft or mock test is not approval to enable production writes.

24
00:01:28,381 --> 00:01:32,896
When separately validated and enabled, the approved worker processes hosts

25
00:01:32,946 --> 00:01:37,469
sequentially and verifies retained management connectivity and both assignments.

26
00:01:37,656 --> 00:01:41,104
A failed or uncertain action stops later hosts.

27
00:01:41,283 --> 00:01:45,421
Keep completed work recorded and reconcile the actual bridges before a new

28
00:01:45,421 --> 00:01:49,122
plan; there is no automatic retry or rollback.
